1 REM FBCS FIL-0124
2 REM CLAIM A-11.3.4.4-02
3 REM TYPE SELF
4 REM A pending partial record ("A";) is completed after SET ZONEWIDTH 8: the new width applies (11.3.4.4 l.7626-7628).
5 REM The leading comma then moves from column 2 to the next zone start, column 9 (10.3.4.3 l.5472-5476): 7 blanks.
100 PRINT "FIL-0124 SET ZONEWIDTH INDEX ABOVE ZERO, APPLIED TO A PENDING PARTIAL RECORD (11.3.4.4)"
110 OPEN #1: NAME "FIL0124.DAT", ACCESS OUTIN, ORGANIZATION SEQUENTIAL, RECTYPE DISPLAY
120 PRINT #1: "A";
130 SET #1: ZONEWIDTH 8
140 ASK #1: ZONEWIDTH Z
150 PRINT #1:, "B"
160 SET #1: POINTER BEGIN
170 LINE INPUT #1: L$
180 CLOSE #1
190 IF Z = 8 AND L$ = "A       B" THEN PRINT "*** TEST PASSED ***" ELSE PRINT "*** TEST FAILED: Z="; Z; " <"; L$; ">"
200 END
